      "instance_name": "islamophobia_stereotype",
      "label": "Islamophobia Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that Muslims are inherently associated with terrorism, which is a core component of Islamophobia. This stereotype is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the inflammatory nature of the text overlay. The phrase 'biggest terrorists in the history of the world' targets an entire religious group based on a false and dangerous generalization.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
