      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "david_cameron_political_context",
      "label": "David Cameron's Political Context",
      "description": "David Cameron was the Prime Minister of the United Kingdom from 2010 to 2016 and was a prominent figure in the Conservative Party. His image in the context of a political rally (as seen in the image) is essential to understanding the celebratory scene. The meme uses his public persona to juxtapose with hateful rhetoric, making the contrast more potent. The 'Conservative Campaign Centre' sign in the background further anchors the scene in his political campaign context.",
